---
title: MF-05 Client pays a fee through VNPay
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Client Company User
  participant FE as Web app (Billing page)
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant VP as VNPay (sandbox)
  actor A as Platform Admin

  C->>FE: Pay with VNPay (posting fee / Sourcing deposit / service fee)
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/payments/vnpay {targetType, targetId}
  API->>DB: check own company, fee payable, reuse unexpired PENDING payment
  API->>DB: insert OnlinePayment PENDING (TxnRef, amount)
  API-->>FE: payment URL signed with HMAC-SHA512
  FE->>VP: redirect, Client pays with a test card
  VP->>API: GET /payments/vnpay/ipn (signed callback)
  alt bad signature / unknown order / wrong amount
    API-->>VP: RspCode 97 / 01 / 04, nothing recorded
  else already confirmed
    API-->>VP: RspCode 02
  else valid callback
    API->>DB: claim PENDING -> PROCESSING
    alt VNPay success
      API->>DB: record fee PAID with reference VNPAY-<transaction no> (same command as Admin)
      API->>DB: OnlinePayment SUCCEEDED (NEEDS_REVIEW if the fee is no longer payable)
      API-->>A: in-app notification
    else cancelled / failed
      API->>DB: OnlinePayment FAILED, fee stays unpaid
    end
    API-->>VP: RspCode 00
  end
  VP->>FE: redirect to /client/billing/vnpay-return
  FE->>API: GET /payments/vnpay/return (same confirmation, idempotent)
  API-->>FE: payment result
  FE-->>C: Paid / cancelled message
